  "New messages read aloud": "大声读取新信件",
  "Next unread": "下一个未读",
  "No. Although this was an automatic process in the past (before v3.2.0), waiting for the spies providers to update proved to cause some delays in certain situations (during weekends, big wars or competitions), which in turn was making Torn PDA's interface slower as it was waiting for this data.\n\nTo avoid this, spies need to be updated manually. Please remember to do so as instructed by your faction, or before chaining, warring, etc.": "号 虽然这是过去(在V3.2.0之前)的一个自动过程,等待间谍提供商更新证明在某些情况下(周末、大规模战争或竞赛期间)造成一些延误,这反过来又使Torn PDA的接口在等待这一数据时放慢。\n\n为了避免这种情况,间谍需要手工更新。 请记住按照你们派系的指示 或在连击、交战等之前",
  "Nothing here is saved or backed up": "这里没有东西被保存或备份",
  "Of the last message in the chat list": "聊天列表中的最后一条消息",
  "On Android, private chat notifications have a Reply button to answer without opening the app": "私人聊天通知有应答按钮,无需打开应用程序",
  "On Android, the floating window shrinks the app into a small window that stays on top of other apps, so you can keep an eye on the chain or on a player while you do something else.\n\nTap the window icon in the chain widget to watch the chain: you get the counter, the chain watcher colors, a border that blinks when time is running out and, with panic mode on and panic targets set, a Panic attack button.\n\nIn Targets, War and Retaliation, choose 'Watch players' in the options menu (the gear icon); in Attacks and FFScouter, tap the window icon in the top bar. The cards get a checkbox: tap up to 4 of them and then 'Watch' in the bar (the X or the back button leaves without watching). With one player the window shows their name and counts down their hospital or jail time; with several, one row each, whoever gets out first on top. A player turns green for 30 seconds when their status changes, and Profile opens that player.\n\nTap the Floating window button in the Stakeouts page to watch all your stakeouts at once and highlight the latest alert.\n\nWhile any floating window is open, stakeout alerts show as a banner for a few seconds and as a phone notification (type 'Stakeouts', which you can mute separately).\n\nIn Settings you can turn the floating window on or off, globally and for each place, and choose to open the chain window automatically when you leave the app with the chain watcher on (off by default). Closing it with the system X is like leaving the app: the chain watcher stops alerting.\n\nPress and hold the window icon for a short explanation.": "Android, 漂浮窗口将应用程序缩入一个小窗口, 保存在其他应用程序之上, 这样你就可以在做其他事情时 监视连击或玩家。\n\n将窗口图标放入连击部件以观察连击:你得到柜台、连击守望者颜色,一个在时间流逝时闪烁的边框,随着恐慌模式和恐慌目标设置,一个恐慌攻击按钮。\n\n在目标、战争和报复中,在选项菜单(齿轮图标)中选择“观察玩家”;在攻击和FFScuter中,在顶部栏中点击窗口图标。 纸牌会得到一个复选框:先录到4张,然后在酒吧里放“观察”(X或后按钮不看就离开)。 窗口用一个玩家显示他们的名字, 计算他们的医院或监狱时间; 数列, 每排一排, 谁先出局, 谁先出局。 当一个玩家更改状态时, 变绿30秒, 配置打开此播放器。\n\n将浮动窗口的按钮放入监视页面, 以便立即观看您所有的监视, 并突出显示最新警告。\n\n当任何浮动窗口打开时, 监视警报作为标语显示几秒钟, 并作为电话通知( 类型为“ 监视” , 您可以单独屏蔽) 。\n\n在设置中,您可以打开或关闭浮动窗口,全球和每个地方,并选择在使用链式监视器(默认关闭)时自动打开链式窗口。 用系统X关闭它就像离开应用程序: 锁链监视器停止警告。\n\n按住窗口图标进行简短解释。",
  "On top of the system text size. Only the messages change": "在系统文本大小的顶部。 只更改信件",
  "On top: first, above pinned chats. By activity: mixed with the rest. Social tab: a tab of their own": "上面:首先,在固定的聊天上方。 按活动:与其他人混合。 社交选项卡:他们自己的标签",
  "On wide screens (tablets, unfolded foldables or large Android windows) you can show two groups of browser tabs at once.\n\nFirst choose 'Browser left' or 'Browser right' in Settings / Split screen. On phones and foldables, also enable 'Allow auto rotation'.\n\nThen double-tap a tab and use the split icon to open it in a second panel, where the app was. Each panel has its own tabs and its own + button, and the same icon moves a tab to the other panel.\n\nYou can also press and hold a tab and drag it onto the app or the other panel. Dragging the main tab opens a copy of it.\n\nWhere links tapped in the app open is chosen in Settings, next to Split screen.\n\nTo close an empty panel, tap its X and the app comes back.\n\nTo resize the panels, press and hold the divider, then drag it.": "在宽屏幕上(表格、展出折叠式或大型安道尔特窗口),您可以同时显示两组浏览器标签。\n\n在设置/分割屏幕中首先选择“ 浏览器左侧” 或“ 浏览器右侧” 。 在电话和折叠机上, 也启用“ Allow 自动旋转 ” 。\n\n然后双脚绘制一个标签, 并使用分割图标在第二个面板中打开它, 应用程序是在那里。 每个面板都有自己的制表符和自己的 + 按钮,同一图标将一个制表符移动到另一个面板上。\n\n也可以按下并按住一个标签并将其拖放到应用程序或其他面板上。 拖着主标签打开它的副本。\n\n在设置中选择在“分割”屏幕旁边的应用程序打开中的链接。\n\n要关闭一个空面板, 点击它的 X 程序就会回来。\n\n要调整面板的大小, 按住和按住分隔符, 然后拖动它。",
  "One set per app theme": "每个应用程序主题一套",
  "Only private chats notify with the app closed. Faction, company and other rooms alert while it is open or just left": "只有私人聊天通知程序已关闭。 开放或刚离开时的派别、公司和其他房间警报",
  "Only the messages in the quick reply of the chat list": "只对聊天列表的快速回复中的留言",
  "Only when mentioned": "仅在提及",
  "Outside private chats, acts on who wrote it": "在外面私下聊天,跟谁写",
  "Panic Mode (chain watcher)": "恐慌模式(链监视器)",
  "People": "人民人民人民",
  "Phone": "电话电话",
  "Pick a time on your clock to add it as TCT. Tap any TCT time in a message to see it in your time": "在你的时钟上挑一个时间 添加它作为TCT。 在信息中播放任何 TCT 时间, 以便在您的时间看到",
  "Pick how a room behaves in its Alerts and mute, or in Chat settings > Rooms. Live updates in real time, like Torn's chat. Frozen saves battery: no messages, alerts or bubble count until you unfreeze it or its time ends. Opening it still shows the latest messages. Hidden takes it out of the list and the counts, and Hidden rooms, at the end of the list, brings it back": "选择一个房间在警报和哑音中,或在聊天设置 > 房间里的行为方式。 实时现场更新 和Torn的聊天一样 冻结保存电池:在解冻或解冻结束之前,没有信息、警报或气泡计数。 开张时仍显示最新消息。 隐藏将它从列表和计数中取出 隐藏房间,在列表的结尾 把它带回来",
  "Pick the chat background, your bubbles and theirs, and their text, for each app theme in Chat settings > Appearance > Colors. The preview changes as you pick. Reset puts the theme back to default": "选择聊天设置 > 外观 > 颜色中每个应用程序主题的聊天背景、 您的气泡及其文本。 预览随您选择而改变。 重置将主题重放到默认值",
  "Pick which bars, timers and cooldowns to put in the message": "选择要放入信件的条、 计时器和冷却器",
  "Placement, live or frozen, unread": "放置、活的或冷冻的,未读",
  "Player card": "玩家卡",
  "Players with a nickname, a name color or a highlight": "带有昵称、名称颜色或突出显示的玩家",
  "Press and hold for the other one. Expanded shows the whole message with Open and Reply": "按住另一个 以 Open 和 Refer 显示整个信件",
  "Preview lines": "预览行",
  "Price check": "价格检查",
  "Quick actions, replies, long press": "快速行动、回复、长新闻",
  "Quick replies": "快速答复",
  "Quick return": "快速返回",
  "Quick vault access": "快速金库进入",
  "Reading": "阅读",
  "Replies": "答复答复",
  "Reply from notifications": "对通知的答复",
  "Request attack assistance from your faction mates": "要求你的派系伙伴提供攻击援助",
  "Room filters": "房间过滤器",
  "Rooms": "会议室",
  "Safe sending": "安全安全发送",
  "Same as ticker follows the ticker levels in Alerts": "与提醒中的千位值相同",
  "Same list as Settings > Browser. The bell alerts only in chats set to Everything": "与设置 > 浏览器相同的列表。 只在每件事的聊天中发出钟声警报",
  "Same switch as in Alerts": "与警报中相同的开关",
  "Save the current URL as a shortcut or navigate to an existing one": "将当前 URL 保存为快捷键或导航到已有的快捷键",
  "Screen readers": "屏幕阅读器",
  "Sending": "发送",
  "Settings": "设置",
  "Share from Torn PDA": "旧 PDA 股份",
  "Share in and out": "分股和分股",
  "Share tab adds the link of an open tab, and Share script one of your scripts. Others see a script link as a card they can install in Torn PDA": "共享选项卡 添加打开标签的链接, 并共享脚本中的脚本之一。 其他人则将脚本链接视为可以安装在Torn PDA 中的卡片",
  "Share tab or script": "共享选项卡或脚本",
  "Short names players use, like xans for Xanax": "使用短名播放器, 如 Xanax 的 xans 等",
  "Short tap vs. long-press": "短打与长拍",
  "Shown under the bolt next to the message box. Pick what each row shows, then turn actions on or off and drag the handle to reorder them": "在消息框旁边的螺栓下显示。 选择每行显示的, 然后打开或关闭动作并拖动控点以重新排序",
  "Small bubbles next to the bubble hold your minimized chats. Tap one to reopen it, or hold it to dismiss it. Long press the bubble to see them all in a list. The chat window minimizes into the bubble, or into a small bubble of its own if you open the chat from somewhere else. To get your open windows and full chat back after a restart, turn on Reopen chats as I left them in Chat settings > Chat button": "在泡沫旁边的小泡泡 支撑着你们最小的聊天 一个打开它, 或拿它来撤销它。 长时间按气泡 可以看到他们全部在列表中。 聊天窗口将最小化到泡沫中, 或进入它自己的小泡沫中, 如果你从别处打开聊天。 要在重新启动后获得打开的窗口和全部聊天, 请打开在聊天设置 > 聊天按钮时留下的重新打开聊天的话题",
  "Sound and vibration": "声音和振动",
  "Status": "状态",
  "Status at the top": "顶部状态",
  "Swipe a chat in the list, long press it, or use the menu at the top of a chat to mark it as unread. It counts as unread, on this device only, until you open it": "浏览列表中的聊天, 按长时间, 或者在聊天的顶端使用菜单将其标记为未读。 它计为未读, 仅在此设备上, 直到您打开它",
  "Swipe a message": "发送消息",
  "Swipe a private chat the other way, or long press it and pick Archive. It leaves the list and the unread count but stays open in Torn, and comes back when they write again. Archived, at the end of the list, has Unarchive. This is on this device only": "换个方式私下聊天 或者按下它然后选择档案室 它留下列表和未读数, 但仍开放在Torn, 当他们再次写的时候回来。 在列表结尾处存档的无政府文件。 仅此设备上",
  "Swipe left on a message": "信件上留下的擦拭",
  "Swipe right to reply. Outside private chats, swipe left to act on who wrote it: chat, profile, attack, trade, bazaar or mail. Pick which one in Chat settings > Writing & actions > Message actions": "窃取答辩权。 在私人聊天室外,他们转而对写作者采取行动:聊天、简介、攻击、买卖、集市或邮件。 在聊天设置 > 写入和动作 > message 动作中选择哪一个",
  "Sync targets with YATA": "与 YATA 同步目标",
  "Sync with Torn Exchange": "同步与撕交换",
  "Sync with TornW3B": "与破 W3B 同步",
  "TalkBack and VoiceOver read each message as one line, with its links, times and gestures in the actions menu. The bubble, windows, ticker, chat list and browser chat icon have their gestures there too, moving included, and notices with Undo wait for you": "TalkBack和VoiceOver将每条信息读为一行,并在行动菜单中显示其链接、时间和手势。 泡泡、窗口、剪切器、聊天列表和浏览器聊天图标也有他们的手势,",
  "Tap an underlined amount like 1.2m, 850k or \\\$1,500 to see the exact figure. Turn on Compare amounts with your cash in Chat settings > Messages & links to see if your cash on hand covers it": "a 下划线数额, 如 1.2m、850k 或\\ 1500美元, 以查看确切数字。 在聊天设置 > Messages & link 中打开与您现金比较金额的比较, 以查看您的手头现金是否覆盖了它",
  "Tap in the options (gear) icon in the app bar. If there are any hidden targets, you'll be able to unhide them from there.": "在应用程序栏中的选项( 齿轮) 图标中安装磁带。 如果有任何隐藏的目标, 你可以从那里解开它们。",
  "Tap it to open the chat, or a small menu when the in-app chat is off. Double tap it to hide or show Torn's own chat in that tab. Long press it for Window, Full chat, Chat settings and hiding Torn's chat in every tab. With Browser picked in Chat settings > Chat button, it shows in every tab with your unread counts": "或一个小菜单 当在应用程序的聊天关闭。 双击它来隐藏或显示 Torn自己的聊天在标签。 长时间按下窗口、全聊天、聊天设置和将Torn的谈话隐藏在每一个标签中。 在聊天设置 > 聊天按钮中选择浏览器时, 它会显示在您未读计数的每个标签页",
  "Tap it to open the full chat, or a chat window if you pick Window in Chat settings > Chat button. Long press it for Window, Full chat and Chat settings. Drag it anywhere, or push it against an edge to tuck it away and tap it to bring it back. A double tap marks your chats as read, with Undo. Global, Trade, hidden and archived chats are skipped. A red cloud means the chat is not connected. To have the chat button in the browser or the side menu instead, pick Browser, Menu header or Menu bar in Chat settings > Chat button": "如果您在聊天设置 > 聊天按钮中选择窗口, 则按下它打开全部聊天或聊天窗口。 按下窗口、 完整聊天和聊天设置的长键。 把它拖到任何地方 或把它推向边缘 把它塞起来 然后把它拍下来带回来 和Undo一起双击标记你的聊天是读的 全球、贸易、隐藏和存档的聊天被忽略。 红云表示聊天没有连接。 要在浏览器或侧菜单中选择聊天按钮,请在聊天设置 > 聊天按钮中选择浏览器、菜单页眉或菜单栏",
  "Tap on bars": "酒吧的磁带",
  "Tap on flag icons": "挂旗图标的磁带",
  "Tap on the faction icon in the app bar and a new dialog will appear.\n\nYou can use the faction's ID if you know it. Otherwise, click on the person icon to the right: this will allow you to enter the ID of any player that belongs to the faction instead.": "在应用程序栏的派系图标上放磁带, 将出现新对话框。\n\n如果你知道,可以使用派别的身份证。 否则, 请单击右侧的人图标 : 这将允许您输入属于该派别的任何玩家的身份。",
  "Tap one to put it in the message box at the cursor. The row shows your favorites, or your most used until you pick some. Tap Emojis to pick favorites and drag them into order": "将它放入光标旁的信息框的磁带 1 。 该行显示您最喜爱的, 或者您最常用的, 直到您选择一些。 将最喜爱的叶莫吉斯踢踏式Emojis 挑取最喜欢的, 并拖动它们排列",
  "Tap one to put it in the message box. Slots fill themselves, or a sheet asks for them. Save replies in Chat settings > Writing & actions > Quick replies, or with Save a reply when the row is empty. Hold a slot there to see what it fills": "一个放进留言箱的磁带 或填满空位,或以工作表要求他们。 将回复保存在聊天设置中 > 写入和动作 > 快速回复,或在行为空时保存回覆。 留一个位子在那里,看看它能填满什么",
  "Tap or hold a name or avatar to see their level and status, attack, trade, add a note or ignore them. It also opens from the top of a private chat, a long press in the chat list or on a mention, and the dots next to friends and search results": "或持有一个名字或阿凡达,以查看其级别和状况、攻击、交易、加注或忽略它们。 也从私人聊天的顶端、聊天列表或提及聊天的长新闻、朋友旁边的点和搜索结果开始。",
  "Tap the chain on top, then Take watch to tell your faction you are watching the chain. The shield shows how many are on watch: orange when someone needs relief, red when nobody watches a chain that can break. A watch ends at its time or when the chain goes into cooldown. The Watcher is your own alarm, separate from watch": "把链子绑在顶上 然后看着告诉你的派别 你正在看着链子 盾牌显示有多少人在监视:当有人需要救济时橙色,当没有人看到能打破的连击时红色。 一只手表在它的时间结束 当连击进入冷却。 监视器是你自己的警报,与手表分开",
  "Tap your name to see your online status and how long you have been away. Tap your ID to open your own profile in the browser, or long-press it to copy the ID.": "窃听您的姓名以查看您的网络状态, 以及您离开多久了。 点击您的 ID 在浏览器中打开您自己的配置文件, 或按长键复制 ID 。",
  "Tapping a notification opens": "标记通知打开",
  "Targets cards with blue (right) border": "蓝色(右)边界目标卡",
  "Testing": "测试测试",
  "Text size": "文本大小",
  "The Floating Action Button is a feature that allows you to perform indirect actions on your tabs as well as some direct navigation actions. It has several functions that are important to know to get the most out of it.\n\nThis can have many uses and help in a multitude of situations. It can also prevent involuntarily activating voice commands or assistants when double- or triple-tapping the bottom edge in some devices.": "浮动动作按钮是一个功能,允许您在标签上执行间接操作以及一些直接导航操作。 它有几项职能,必须知道如何充分利用这些职能。\n\n这在多种情况下可以有许多用途和帮助。 它还可以防止在某些装置中双倍或三倍触动底层边缘时非自愿激活语音指令或助理。",
  "The War section, inside of Chaining, is designed to help with faction warring. You can add entire enemy factions, sort their members, hide the ones you don't want to see, and use the list as you would with the standard chaining list to attack several players in a row.": "连击店内部的战争区 旨在帮助派系交战 你可以加上整个敌人派别, 排序其成员, 隐藏那些你不想看到的, 并使用该列表 与标准连击列表一样, 攻击几个玩家在一排。",
  "The Wiki chip searches the wiki and adds the link. In the New players room, tap an underlined term like OC or xanax to see what it means. Chat settings > Messages & links > Explain Torn slang everywhere does it in every chat": "维基芯片搜索维基并添加链接。 在新球员室里,用下划线的词,比如OC或xanax来说明它的含义。 聊天设置 > messages & link > 解释每段聊天中随处可见的 Torn 朗声",
  "The bubble": "泡沫",
  "The bubble flashes in the color of the room the message came from. With Bubble picked in Chat settings > Chat button, choose Same as ticker, Custom or Off there. Frozen and hidden rooms never make it glow": "信息来自房间颜色的泡沫闪烁。 在聊天设置 > 聊天按钮中选择了泡泡, 选择相同位置为选中点, 自定义或关闭。 冰冻和隐藏的房间 永远不会让它发光",
  "The buttons under a message you long press. Drag to reorder": "按下您所要按的一条消息中的按钮。 拖放以重新排列顺序",
  "The chat follows your system text size. On top of it, Chat settings > Appearance > Chat text size goes from 80% to 160% for messages and the ticker": "聊天遵循您的系统文本大小。 在上面,聊天设置 > 外观 > 聊天 > 聊天文本大小对信件和选取器而言从80%到160%不等",
  "The chat icon in the browser": "浏览器中的聊天图标",
  "The chat icon in the top bar of a target or member, Share to chat on a foreign stock or ranked war card, and a swipe left on a stakeout put a clean text in the message box of the chat you pick. Nothing goes out until you tap Send": "目标或成员顶端栏的聊天图标, 分享在外国股票上或名牌上聊天, 在你拍到之前 没有什么会出去的 发送",
  "The chat in the side menu": "侧边菜单中的聊天",
  "The chat uses your Torn login, like the website. Sign in at Settings > Torn Authentication with Google, Apple (iOS) or your Torn email and password, and the chat connects by itself. If Torn asks for a two-factor code, enter it in the browser": "聊天使用您的Torn登录, 就像网站一样。 签名在设置 < 撕破身份验证与 Google、 苹果( IOS) 或您的撕破电子邮件和密码, 以及聊天本身连接。 如果Torn 要求两个因素的代码, 请在浏览器中输入",
  "The chat window": "聊天窗口",
  "The chat window floats over the app. Drag its top bar to move it and the corner to resize it. The buttons on top minimize it and open the full chat. More has Chat settings and Maximize window, which only makes the window fill the screen. In a conversation, the small window button pops it out on its own": "聊天窗口在应用程序上浮动。 拖动顶部栏以移动它和角以调整其大小。 顶部的按钮将最小化并打开全部聊天。 更多有聊天设置和最大化窗口, 这只能让窗口填满屏幕。 在一次谈话中,小窗口按钮 自行弹出它",
  "The chat you have open reads out new messages: all of them in private, faction and company chats, only mentions and highlight words elsewhere. Ticker lines stay until you dismiss them": "你公开的聊天会读出新的信息:所有这些都是在私人、派别和公司聊天中, 排队留到你开除为止",
  "The faction chat shows your chain and ranked war on top, with a note when the chain gets low, and who is online under them. The crossed swords open targets, war, retals and the finder at any time. Watch retals, in the Retals tab, adds a line for each retal. Choose what shows in Chat settings > Faction room": "派系聊天显示你的连击关系, 并排在最上面的战争, 当连击关系变得低时, 十字剑打开目标 战争 战利品 和发现者在任何时候 观察回调,在Retals标签中,为每回调增加一条线。 选择在聊天设置 > Faction 室中显示什么",
  "The pencil next to the help button picks what each row shows: actions, emojis or saved replies. Turn actions on or off and drag them into order. With more than one action row, drag the Row markers to split them": "帮助按钮旁边的铅笔选择每行显示的内容:动作、演示或保存回复。 打开或关闭动作, 并拖动它们按顺序进行。 用多个动作行, 拖曳行标记以拆分",
  "The settings button at the top of the full chat opens Chat settings. So do a long press on the chat button, More in a chat window and Chat in the app Settings. This guide is there too, under How the chat works": "完全聊天顶端的设置按钮打开聊天设置。 所以在聊天按钮上按一个长的按键, 更多在聊天窗口和聊天在应用程序设置中。 这本指南也是有的 聊天方式下",
  "The size follows the chat text size in Appearance": "在外观中, 大小跟随聊天文本的大小",
  "The strip above the chat list shows private chats where they wrote last and you have not answered for a few hours. Tap a name to open it, or swipe it away or tap its X until they write again. It does not add to the unread count. Set the hours, or turn it off, in Chat settings > Rooms > Waiting for you": "聊天名单上方的条纹显示他们最后写的私人聊天,但你几小时没有回复。 打开它, 或把它擦掉, 或点击它的X 直到他们再次写。 它没有增加未读数。 在聊天设置 > 房间 > 等候您",
  "Their messages are hidden only in Torn PDA. Tap a name in the chat to ignore someone. Players you block in Torn are hidden too": "他们的讯息只隐藏在撕破的PDA里。 窃听聊天中的名字 忽略某人。 您在Torn 中阻挡的玩家也被隐藏",
  "There are a couple of ways to update war targets.\n\nWith a short tap, you can perform a quick update with minimal target information (some stats and life information won't be available).\n\nA long-press will start a slower but full update of all targets.\n\nAlternatively, you can update targets individually. This also show expanded information.": "有几种方法可以更新战争目标\n\n短话短说后,您可以使用最起码的目标信息(一些数据和生命信息将无法提供)快速更新。\n\n长新闻将开始对所有目标进行缓慢但全面的更新。\n\n或者,你可以单独更新目标。 这还表明信息有所扩展。",
  "Time on screen": "屏幕上的时间",
  "To close a tab, you have two options: you can either DOUBLE TAP it to access the vertical menu and do it from there (with the red bin icon), or alternatively with a TRIPLE TAP, which will close the selected tab instantly (except for the first one, which is persistent).": "要关闭一个标签, 您有两个选项 : 您可以使用 DOUBLE TAP 访问垂直菜单并从中( 使用红色的 bin 图标) , 或者使用 TRIPLE TAP 即时关闭选中的标签( 第一个选项除外, 第一个选项是持久性的 ) 。",
  "To move a tab in the bar, maintain the tab pressed for a couple of seconds and then drag it to the desired position.\n\nNote: the position of the first tab can't be changed.": "要移动栏中的标签, 请按住标签几秒钟, 然后拖到想要的位置。\n\n注:第一个标签的位置无法更改。",
  "Toggle attack assist messages": "切换攻击协助信息",
  "Toggle between icons and page titles in the tabs bar": "在标签栏的图标和页面标题之间切换",
  "Torn PDA asks before sending something that looks like an API key. Turn on Confirm messages to public rooms in Chat settings > Writing & actions to be asked before writing in rooms like Global or Trade too": "PDA在发送看起来像 API 密钥的东西前询问。 打开对聊天设置 > 写作和动作中公共房间的信件的确认,然后才能在Global or Trade 等房间里写入信件。",
  "Torn PDA reads these lines when typed exactly in the faction chat, also from the web. \"[PDA] Hitting Name in 30s - at 14:05:19 TCT\": the TCT time when the seconds end, 600s at most. \"[PDA] Joining Name\" and \"[PDA] Not joining Name\". \"[PDA] Watching the chain until 14:30 TCT\", \"[PDA] Done watching the chain\" and \"[PDA] Need a chain watcher from 15:10 TCT\", the time being optional in the last one. \"[PDA] Retal available: Name - 1.2B (spy) - until 14:05:19 TCT - https://www.torn.com/page.php?sid=attack&user2ID=1234567\": the stats part is optional and the TCT time is when the retal ends, 5 minutes at most": "当恰好在派系聊天中输入时, 也来自网络的Torn PDA 读取这些线条。 “ [PDA] 点击姓名30秒 - 14: 05: 19 TCT ” : 秒结束时的 TCT 时间, 最多为 600 秒。 “ [PDA] 联合姓名 ” 和 “ [PDA] 不加入姓名 ” 。 “ [PDA] 监视链直到2. 230 TCT 之前的“ [PDA] 监视链 ”, “ [PDA] 完成监视链” 和 “[PDA] 需要从 15: 10 TCT 开始的链监视器 ” , 这是最后一个选项。 “ [PDA] Retal: name - 1.2B (spy) - 到 14: 05: 19 TCT - https://www. destrate.com/ page.phpage. sid?sid= attack&userence&user2ID=1234567” : \" stat is part is chots is the the the time the tate and the the the tate, 5 by the time",
  "Torn PDA will update each faction's roster upon entering the Chaining section (at intervals not lower than 1 hour) or whenever a global update is performed by the user.": "撕破的PDA将在进入链路部分(间隔不少于1小时)或用户进行全球更新时更新每个派别的名册。",
  "Torn native login": "撕刻的本地登录",
  "Torn stops their private messages and mail to you. Same list as Torn's chat and mail ignore list": "撕毁他们的私人信息 和邮件给你。 与 Torn 的聊天列表和邮件忽略列表相同的列表",
  "Torn wiki": "圆维基",
  "Trading calculator": "交易计算器",
  "Try tapping or long-pressing main bars (energy, nerve, happy, life) to access their main sections in Torn.": "尝试利用或长期压抑主条(能量、神经、快乐、生命)进入其位于Torn的主要部分。",
  "Try tapping or long-pressing the cash and points icons!": "尝试敲敲或长打现金和点图标!",
  "Two groups of tabs side by side": "并排两组制表符",
  "Unread": "未读",
  "Unread counts shown": "显示未读计数",
  "Updating faction targets": "更新派别目标",
  "Use Filter in a room's menu to show only, or hide, messages with some words. Your own messages, mentions and highlighted words always show": "使用房间菜单中的过滤器只显示或隐藏含有某些单词的信息。 您自己的信息、 提及和突出显示的文字总是显示",
  "Use terminal (developers only)": "使用终端( 仅开发者)",
  "Use the chat in different tabs": "在不同标签中使用聊天",
  "Userscripts development": "用户描述开发",
  "Using shortcuts": "使用快捷键",
  "Watch, targets and friends": "观察、目标、朋友",
  "What adds to the unread counts": "添加未读计数的内容",
  "What are spies? How are exact enemy stats retrieved?": "什么是间谍? 准确的敌人数据是如何检索到的?",
  "What browser should I use?": "我该用什么浏览器?",
  "What does 'Override old spies' do?": "\"接管老间谍\"是做什么的?",
  "What does 'Prefer FFScouter battle score' do?": "弗斯科特战役得分是做什么的?",
  "What functions does it have?": "它有哪些功能?",
  "What is FFScouter?": "什么是FFSFCUATER? (FSFCUATER)",
  "What is this section for?": "这部分是用来做什么的?",
  "What's the Floating Action Button": "浮动动作按钮是什么",
  "When abroad, you will be able to see a house icon in the app bar that will start your flight back immediately (press it twice!).": "当您在国外时, 您可以在应用程序栏中看到一个房屋图标, 该图标将立即开始返回( 两次按下它! ) 。",
  "When checking the foreign stocks, tapping on the flag of a particular item will transport you to the Travel Agency and check whether you have enough money available (this is based on your 'items capacity', which you can set at the options bar).": "当检查外国库存时, 点击某物品的旗帜会将您运送到旅行社, 并检查您是否有充足的可用资金(这是基于您的“ 物品容量” , 您可以在选项栏设定 ) 。",
  "When enabled, war/retal cards and profile checks will show the FFScouter battle score estimate (e.g. ~12.5M, shown in orange) instead of the vague range (e.g. 2M-25M) for targets that have not been spied.\n\nThe same estimate is used for sorting, the Total Stats filter slider, and the SmartScore calculation. Estimates are cached locally for 24 hours to minimize API calls.\n\nDisabling this setting clears the local cache.": "启用时, 战争/ 退役卡和剖面检查将显示FFScuter 战斗分数估计值( 如~ 12. 5M, 以橙色显示) , 而不是没有被监视的目标的模糊范围( 如 2M- 25M )。\n\n同一估计数用于分类、总量统计过滤滑动器和智能核心计算。 估计数在当地预留24小时,以尽量减少API电话。\n\n禁用此设置可清除本地缓存。",
  "When the 'Prefer FFScouter battle score' option is active, a slider appears that lets you set a spy age threshold (1–12 months).\n\nIf a target has spied stats that are older than the configured threshold and FFScouter has a battle score estimate for that target, the FFS value will replace the spied stats on the card. A small clock icon indicates this override.\n\nSorting, filters, and SmartScore will also use the FFS value in that case.\n\nSet the slider to 'Off' to always keep spied stats regardless of age.": "当“ Prefer FFFScuter 战斗得分” 选项激活时, 一个滑动器显示您可以设定间谍年龄的门槛(1-12个月) 。\n\n如果目标的监视状态比设定的临界值要长,而FFFScuter对目标的战斗得分估计值,FFSF值将取代卡片上的监视状态。 小时钟图标表示此重置。\n\n在这种情况下,排序、过滤和SmartScore也将使用FFS值。\n\n将滑动器设为“ 关闭” 以保持监视状态, 不论年龄大小。",
  "When the system asks for fewer animations, the chat jumps instead of animating and the bubble does not flash with new messages": "当系统要求更少动画时,聊天跳而不是动动画,泡沫不会用新消息闪烁",
  "When you add a faction, some of its members information won't be retrieved from the API to avoid unnecessary API calls. However, this information will be updated as soon as you update an individual target or perform a global update (via the app bar).": "当你添加一个派别时, 其成员中有些信息不会从 API 获取, 以避免不必要的 API 电话。 然而,一旦您更新了单个目标或进行了全球更新(通过应用程序栏),这一信息将立即更新。",
  "When you are in hospital, you'll get the chance to call a reviver by using the icon that appears in the Profile section (status card).\n\nYou can use several reviving partners (you can activate or deactivate them separately in Settings).\n\nYour call will automatically alert all available revivers in the selected partner's Discord channel.\n\nHave a look at the information contained in the revive dialog and be aware that this is a paid service!": "住院后,您将有机会通过使用概况部分(状态卡)中显示的图标来呼叫恢复器。\n\n您可以使用多个恢复伙伴(您可以在设置中单独激活或禁用它们)。\n\n您的电话将自动提醒选中伙伴的 Discord 频道中所有可用的恢复器。\n\n看看恢复对话中的信息, 并意识到这是付费服务!",
  "When you are in the attack screen, the browser's URL menu (accessed by short tapping the title bar in the 'default' browser style or the CLOSE button in the two other styles) will show a new button, marked in red, labelled 'FACTION ASSISTANCE'.\n\nTapping this button will send a notification to all your faction mates that use Torn PDA and have the 'Faction assist messages' option enabled in the Alerts section.\n\nBy tapping the notification they will be able to join your attack and provide assistance.": "当您在攻击屏幕中时,浏览器的 URL 菜单(通过简短点击“ 默认” 浏览器样式中的标题栏或另外两种样式中的 CLOSE 按钮) 将显示一个新的按钮, 以红色标出, 标有“ FACTION 协助” 。\n\n点击此按钮将发送通知给使用Torn PDA 并在警告部分启用“ 行动协助信息” 选项的所有派别伴侣。\n\n通过窃听通知,他们将能够加入你们的攻击并提供援助。",
  "Where rooms go": "会议室出入口",
  "Where the chat button lives, with your unread count": "聊天按钮住在哪里,您没有读数",
  "Where's the last online information gone?": "最后的线上信息去了哪里?",
  "While in the Trade section in game, you'll have a button for quick access to your vaults available in the main app bar.\n\nAfter tapping on it you will be redirected to your choice and the full browser close icon will change from a cross to an arrow, indicating that it will redirect you back to the trade instead of closing the browser.": "在赛场的Trade部分, 你会有一个按钮 快速访问您在主应用程序栏中的金库。\n\n点击它后, 您将被重定向到您的选择上, 整个浏览器的关闭图标将从十字架转换为箭头, 表示它会将您重定向到行业而不是关闭浏览器。",
  "While the app is open": "应用程序在打开时",
  "Why can't I see organized crimes in the Profile Section?": "为什么我不能在档案科看到有组织犯罪?",
  "Why does a target still show spied stats even with override enabled?": "为什么一个目标仍然显示监视状态? 即使启用了超控制 也如此?",
  "Why is Torn PDA selected as my default browser for Torn?": "为什么Torn PDA 被选中为我默认的 Torn 浏览器?",
  "Why is some information (e.g. life and stats) missing?": "为什么缺少一些信息(例如生命和统计)?",
  "Widget interaction": "部件交互",
  "Widget theme": "部件主题",
  "With the app closed": "应用程序关闭后",
  "Words you add in Settings > Browser > Highlight words also show in the chat. In Chat settings > Alerts > Highlight words, the bell next to a word alerts for it, only in chats with Alert on set to Everything": "您在设置 > 浏览器 > 高亮字词中添加的单词也在聊天中显示。 在聊天设置 > 提醒 > 中,提醒 > 突出单词、 单词提示旁边的铃声, 仅在与 \" 一切事物都设置提醒 \" 的聊天中进行",
  "Writing & actions": "写入动作( A)",
  "Yes. Swipe left on the target's card to hide it.": "对 在目标卡上留下的擦拭 隐藏它。",
  "Yes. Swipe right on the target's card to pin/unpin it.": "对 在目标的卡上擦一下 来打针/打针",
  "Yes. Tap on the faction icon in the app bar and then use the 'eye' icon.": "对 在应用程序栏的派系图标上放磁带,然后使用“ 眼睛” 图标。",
  "You can add as many custom shortcuts as you like. There is also a long list available with pre-configured shortcuts. Tapping or long-pressing shortcut tiles will open a quick or full browser.": "您可以随意添加自定义快捷键。 还有一个长长的清单,附有预先配置的捷径。 塔普或长压快捷键砖将打开一个快速或完整的浏览器。",
  "You can add or remove targets from the Panic Mode list either via the chain widget's options menu or by swiping left on any target card.": "您可以通过连击部件的选项菜单或通过擦拭任何目标卡上留下的目标,从“恐慌模式”列表中添加或删除目标。",
  "You can do all this in the Settings section (look for the spies subsection). You will be able to see what your current provider is, how many spies are synced, when were they retrieved for the last time, swap providers and update your spies list.\n\nFor convenience, this is also accesible through the options (gear) icon in the War and Retals sections (inside of Chaining).": "您可以在设置区域( 查找间谍小节) 中做所有这一切。 你将能看到你目前的提供商是什么, 有多少间谍被同步, 当他们最后一次被检索到的时候, 交换提供商和更新你的间谍名单。\n\n为了方便起见,这也可以通过战争和金属部分(紧闭区外)的选项(齿轮)图标来理解。",
  "You can enable the Floating Action Button in Settings, under Advanced Browser Settings, by finding the Floating Action Button section.\n\nHere, you can also configure other options, such as the direction in which it expands or whether you want to use it only in Full Screen Mode.": "您可以在高级浏览器设置下, 找到浮动动作按钮部分, 从而启用设置中的浮动动作按钮。\n\n在此, 您也可以配置其它选项, 比如它扩展的方向或者您是否想要仅在全屏模式中使用它。",
  "You can export and import your targets to and from YATA. Look for the 'Y' icon in the main app bar when in the Targets section.": "您可以向YATA出口和从YATA进口目标。 在目标区域中, 查找主应用程序栏中的“ Y” 图标。",
  "You can give your tabs (except for the main one) a custom name by using the text/paragraph icon in the vertical tab menu.\n\nYou can also choose whether this custom name will be shown in the tab (default) and/or as a replacement to the page title (which is shown in the default browser style).\n\nPlease note that this name will be lost if you close the tab. This could be particularly useful, however, in combination with the tab locking feature (explained above), so that you can organize your tabs better.": "您可以使用垂直标签菜单中的文本/段落图标给您的制表位(除主选项卡外)一个自定义名称。\n\n您也可以选择该自定义名称是否将显示在标签( 默认) 和/ 或作为页面标题的替换( 在默认浏览器样式中显示) 。\n\n请注意, 如果您关闭此标签, 此名称将会丢失。 然而,这可能会特别有用,同时加上标签锁定功能(上文已解释过),这样您就可以更好地组织您的标签。",
  "You can optionally position the main app bar at the top (default) or bottom (as requested by some users, as it is easier to reach in bigger screens). This can be changed in the Settings section.": "您可以选择将主应用程序栏置于顶部( 默认) 或底部( 由某些用户请求, 因为大屏幕更容易到达) 。 这可以在设置区域中更改。",
  "You can temporarily hide it by either long pressing the button or using the three-dotted in the tab bar. The vertical menu that appears includes a button with the same image as the Floating Action Button (a tap), allowing you to toggle it on or off.": "您可以通过按下按钮或使用标签栏中的三点键来暂时隐藏它。 显示的垂直菜单包含一个与浮动动作按钮( 开关) 相同图像的按钮, 允许您打开或关闭它。",
  "You can temporarily hide tabs so that they don't take space.\n\nIf you are using the 'default' browser style: tap and hold the title bar, then slide up or down.\n\nIf you are using the 'bottom-bar' or 'dialog' styles: tap and hold the CLOSE button, then slide up or down.": "你可以暂时隐藏标签 这样他们就不会占用空间。\n\n如果您正在使用“ 默认” 浏览器样式: 点击并按住标题栏, 然后向上或向下滑动。\n\n如果您使用“ 底边栏” 或“ 对话框” 样式: 点击并按住 CLOSE 按钮, 然后向上或向下滑动。",
  "You can toggle this option in the Alerts section.": "您可以在警告部分切换此选项。",
  "You've got a good indication on the user's online status by looking at the indicator in the third row of each card: grey (offline), orange (idle) and green (online).\n\nIf you need more details (like the number of hours offline), tap the indicator and a message will appear.": "浏览每张卡片第三行的标志:灰色(脱线)、橙色(idle)和绿色(在线)。\n\n如果您需要更多细节(如离线时数),请访问该指示器并发布消息。",
  "Your name and ID in the app bar": "应用程序栏中您的姓名和身份",
};
